Module EEPROM regression tests
==============================

Run with make check (pretty dumps must be enabled). The test injects the
EEPROM bytes into the ioctl path and checks raw, text and JSON output.

To add a vector, place three files with the same basename in the module
type directory (sff8079 for 256 bytes or sff8472 for 512 bytes):

  NAME.raw   Hex dump (ethtool -m DEV hex on > NAME.raw).
  NAME.txt   Expected text (ethtool -m DEV).
  NAME.json  Expected JSON (ethtool --json -m DEV).

Use LC_ALL=C when capturing output and check that live diagnostic readings
in the expected files match the values in the hex dump. Every .raw
file is discovered automatically by make check.
